# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# WebGL in Safari (devices/akita TODO 18c: the tester's 3D benchmark ran with no pipeline of ANGLE's in WebKit's GPU
# process): the home screen unlocked, a WebGL page opened through SpringBoard, left 70 s.
